filed":"2025-03-06"},"0000769397-26-000015":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-K","filed":"2026-03-03"},"0000769397-24-000181":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2024-12-03"},"0000769397-25-000071":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-05-29"},"0000769397-25-000117":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-09-02"},"0000769397-25-000129":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-11-26"},"0000769397-26-000044":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-05-29"},"0000769397-26-000061":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-08-28"},"0000769397-24-000150":{"c":"ADSK","form":"10-Q","filed":"2024-09-03"},"0000769397-26-000030":{"c":"ADSK","form":"DEF 14A","filed":"2026-05-06"}},"finsights":{"ADSK":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $2.4 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $2.5 billion less capital spending of $43 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 33.4% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $1.3 billion.","cites":["ADSK.ocf.2026","ADSK.capex.2026","ADSK.revenue.2026","ADSK.ocf.2021","ADSK.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $788 million in FY2026, 10.9% of revenue, against 10.5% in FY2021.","cites":["ADSK.sbc.2026","ADSK.revenue.2026","ADSK.sbc.2021","ADSK.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $1.4 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["ADSK.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-07-31 revenue was $2 billion, up 16.1% from $1.8 billion in the three months ended 2025-07-31.","cites":["ADSK.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","ADSK.d.revenue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $7.8 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2 billion and net income to $1.6 billion.","cites":["ADSK.d.revenue.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","ADSK.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","ADSK.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","ADSK.d.opinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","ADSK.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","ADSK.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","ADSK.d.netinc.2025-08-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","ADSK.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","ADSK.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $2.8 billion: operating cash flow of $2.9 billion less capital spending of $57 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["ADSK.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","ADSK.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","ADSK.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","ADSK.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-07-31","ADSK.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","ADSK.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-07-31","ADSK.d.capex.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","ADSK.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","ADSK.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-05-06 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $30.1 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $24.4 million.","cites":["ADSK.pay.peoTotal.2026","ADSK.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $7.3 million in total and $6 million actually paid.","cites":["ADSK.pay.neoTotal.2026","ADSK.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $91.15 at the end of FY2026, and $133.77 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["ADSK.pay.tsr.2026","ADSK.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $4.4 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $3.8 billion a year earlier.","cites":["ADSK.deferred.2026","ADSK.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 14,300 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $504,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ADSK.q.employees","ADSK.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $197 million.","cites":["ADSK.restructuring.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.2 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $348 million in short-term investments, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermNotesPayable). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $114 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["ADSK.cash.2026","ADSK.sti.2026","ADSK.debtLong.2026"]}]},"fin":{"ADSK":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":26,"read":26,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["CAHILL JOHN T","Director"],["Anagnost Andrew","President and CEO, director"],["Moorjani Janesh","EVP, Chief Financial Officer"],["Smith Stacy J","Director"]],"rows":[["P",0,2000,378400,"2026-06-23","2026-06-23","0001197000-26-000008","2026-06-23",0],["P",1,2460,498543.6,"2026-06-16","2026-06-16","0001661768-26-000004","2026-06-17",0],["P",2,2500,494175,"2026-06-15","2026-06-15","0001662734-26-000006","2026-06-15",0],["P",3,3435,794054.34,"2026-05-29","2026-05-29","0000769397-26-000046","2026-05-29",0]]},"risks":{"compared":true,"prior":"ADSK-0000769397-25-000019","threshold":0.5,"counts":{"now":37,"before":36,"same":35,"reworded":1,"elsewhere":1,"new":0,"removed":0},"new":[],"removed":[],"reworded":[["ADSK.q.riskrw.0","ADSK.q.riskrwwas.0",0.56]]}}},"quotes":{"ADSK.q.employees":{"c":"ADSK","kind":"employees","n":14300,"quote":"As of January 31, 2026, we employed approximately 14,300 people, a decrease from approximately 15,300 employees as of the end of fiscal year 2025.","source":"ADSK-0000769397-26-000015","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-03-03","proof":"decd09fd7abe2c12b1d3f91cb7643682cb3e2585d6862ad9af3baef5b433a563"},"ADSK.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"ADSK","kind":"risk","quote":"Increasing regulatory focus on privacy, data protection, and cybersecurity issues, as well as new and expanding laws and regulations, and customer requirements, addressing AI, data localization and sovereignty, and the collection and processing of data and information, may impact our business and expose us to increased liability.","source":"ADSK-0000769397-26-000015","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-03","proof":"aa1a866e0eb5b71ab2f6d31f076dd4c87d8ee08c338204ccc7088259b9896cae"},"ADSK.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"ADSK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Increasing regulatory focus on privacy, data protection, and information security issues and new and expanding laws may impact our business and expose us to increased liability.","source":"ADSK-0000769397-25-000019","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-06","proof":"b5030d8b1168a12db069d4b95ad8aac762ed64c9132020f55924bf3c23ad51ca"}},"sources":{"ADSK-0000769397-25-000019":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"ADSK","form":"10-K","period":"2025-01-31","date":"2025-03-06","accn":"0000769397-25-000019","title":"Autodesk 10-K for the fiscal year ended 2025-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/769397/000076939725000019/adsk-20250131.htm","sha":"7224e8feee55c968fdd93a5bf52404f4201d4bc4e3f2785fe7cec3c8796a84cf"}}}